	<dc:title xml:lang="ru-RU">Мечта о космосе и её воплощение</dc:title>
	<dc:creator>Zeleniy L.M.</dc:creator>
	<dc:subject xml:lang="en-US">K.E. Tsiolkovsky; RAS Commission for the Development of the Scientific Heritage of K.E. Tsiolkovsky; Jet propulsion research group; Lunar program; popularization of space research</dc:subject>
